# Name Origins

- Etymology + cross-language cognate explorer.
- Aggregate Wikidata (graph) + Behind the Name (enrichment) into our
  Postgres. Never call either source from a user-facing request path —
  reads hit our DB only.
- MVP = etymological naming traditions only. Compositional (CJK) and
  circumstantial (Akan/Yoruba-style) traditions are out of scope — see
  `cultural-scope.mdc`. Do not force-fit them into the current model.
- Prefer the simplest solution at current scale. Do not add services or
  infra not listed in `stack.mdc` without flagging it.
- Items in `docs/open-questions.md` are undecided. Do not silently pick
  an answer in code — flag it in chat first.
- Settled rationale lives in `docs/decisions-log.md`. Revisit only
  deliberately, not by accident mid-build.
